{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FAST PACED RTS SUMMONER SHOOTER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615520/extras/ba279d4fa3ce3da6c0047c73faccb552.poster.avif?t=1760809925\" width=640 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615520/extras/ba279d4fa3ce3da6c0047c73faccb552.webm?t=1760809925\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's be honest. You're a wizard with guns. Anunnaki &amp; The Kingdom of Goku is an RTS game where you alternate between summoner and 3rd person shooter modes on the fly. The game allows you to enjoy controlling units and defending  bases at an exciting and fun pace. You are Goku, the mythical trickster monkey king, born of a stone egg, who seeks to reclaim his kingdom and throne from the vile Illuminati, who now bar your way to the stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TO THE STARS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615520/extras/b8ff53877ff337372024adaaa304665b.poster.avif?t=1760809925\" width=630 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615520/extras/b8ff53877ff337372024adaaa304665b.webm?t=1760809925\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Illuminati have infested both your land and the forbidden Demon Gate with demons and eldritch horrors. Brave the demonic gate, reclaim your territory, gather powerful guns, abilities, and summoning units, and defeat their demon lords. Undo the evil cabal\u2019s machinations, rekindle your kingdom\u2019s lost flame and glory, and ascend to the heavens as is your birthright.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3615520?t=1760809925","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615520/3ed3d4054c6de5cca47e550dec604933b4faefd0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760809925","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615520/eb6cdeb5a9b3f3055c9dc4b851497a7e0b0d5403/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760809925","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615520/eb6cdeb5a9b3f3055c9dc4b851497a7e0b0d5403/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760809925","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3767080,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FAST PACED RTS SUMMONER SHOOTER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615520/extras/ba279d4fa3ce3da6c0047c73faccb552.poster.avif?t=1760809925\" width=640 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615520/extras/ba279d4fa3ce3da6c0047c73faccb552.webm?t=1760809925\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's be honest. You're a wizard with guns. Anunnaki &amp; The Kingdom of Goku is an RTS game where you alternate between summoner and 3rd person shooter modes on the fly. The game allows you to enjoy controlling units and defending  bases at an exciting and fun pace. You are Goku, the mythical trickster monkey king, born of a stone egg, who seeks to reclaim his kingdom and throne from the vile Illuminati, who now bar your way to the stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TO THE STARS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615520/extras/b8ff53877ff337372024adaaa304665b.poster.avif?t=1760809925\" width=630 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615520/extras/b8ff53877ff337372024adaaa304665b.webm?t=1760809925\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Illuminati have infested both your land and the forbidden Demon Gate with demons and eldritch horrors. Brave the demonic gate, reclaim your territory, gather powerful guns, abilities, and summoning units, and defeat their demon lords. Undo the evil cabal\u2019s machinations, rekindle your kingdom\u2019s lost flame and glory, and ascend to the heavens as is your birthright.</p>","developers":["Future Man Future Martian"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615520/6c7e8ae88d808e4604ea026dac0b9ba604e28955/header.jpg?t=1760809925","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3615520/1296883045/291716abb42848214b12aeeb2f40a0d0cf6bc907/1760807218/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760809854","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steams